  "description": "[h1]Bee Abusive Industry[/h1]\nAn industrial bee-processing addon for [b]Frackin' Universe[/b] on [b]OpenStarbound[/b].\n\nThis mod grew from my difficulties automating beekeeping. In the age of AI, its name plays on “Bee A.I.” and “Abusive Industry” — and AI Chips are part of the equipment recipes.\n\nWant to know how everything works? Check out the Workshop discussion:\n\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/discussion/3822748368/573805072991229995/]Learn more about the mod's mechanics[/url]\n\nBy Goblin Man.\n\n[h2]Requirements[/h2]\nRequires OpenStarbound and Frackin' Universe. The vanilla Starbound executable is not supported.\n\nHaven't heard of OpenStarbound? Give it a look — it's worth it! :)\n\n[h2]Genetic Queen Filter[/h2]\nSort inspected Queens and Young Queens using six genetic traits. Choose Equal or higher, Equal or lower, Indifferent, Equal, or Within range for each trait.\n\nThe interface keeps the reference profile visible, and the Approved and Rejected outputs support FU item networks and ITD.\n\n[h2]Auto Refugee[/h2]\nAutomate bee trading using the rewards from the FU Bee Refuge. Sixteen shared slots accept Queens, Young Queens, and batches of five drones of the same species.\n\nHybrid bees cannot be traded here.\n\n[h2]Genetic Hybridizer[/h2]\nBreed a Queen and a Drone from different species to create new hybrid races. With 35 base species, the system allows up to 595 unique hybrid combinations.\n\nEach hybrid combines traits from its parents and can produce resources associated with both species. Research Discs can improve the chance of a successful experiment.\n\n[h2]Overload Apiaries[/h2]\nPut your bees to work harder and increase resource and drone production — by making them suffer, of course.\n\nThe mod includes four models:\n\n[list]\n[*]Overload Apiary: a compact option for your colonies.\n[*]Overload Large Apiary: more room for a larger operation.\n[*]Ov. Framekeeper: boosts production while protecting the inserted frame from wear.\n[*]Ov. Tri-Frame: supports three frames for more frame bonuses.\n[/list]\n\nPowered Overload Apiaries produce 20% more resources and drones. They keep working at normal speed without power, but the Queen's lifespan remains reduced to 80% of normal.\n\n[h2]Bee Genetic Microscope[/h2]\nInstantly reveal a bee's genetic data without producing Research, Pixels, or other rewards. It also supports item networks for automation.\n\n[h2]Genetic Stabilizer[/h2]\nReduce a bee's mutation chance by half with each treatment. There's a catch: every treatment has a 40% chance of destroying the bee.\n\n[h2]Crafting and updates[/h2]\nLearn the recipes in the Frackin' Universe Research Tree!\n\n[h2]Compatibility[/h2]\nCompatible and validated with:\n[list]\n[*]Improved Containers\n[/list]\n\n[h2]Credits[/h2]\nBee sprites, definitions, and systems: Frackin' Universe team, sayterdarkwynd, and contributors. FU material is credited under [url=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/]CC BY 4.0[/url]. Starbound/Terramart assets belong to Chucklefish and their respective contributors. This addon does not imply endorsement by FU or Chucklefish.\n\nAlmost everything in this mod was vibe coded, but tested, planned and validated by me.",
